{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `obs_t_fall` (reshaped to a one-dimensional top-level array in `data_safe.json`).

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: The original elementwise observation statements `obs_t_fall[n, h] ~ normal(...)` occurred inside loops and used an indexed left-hand side, which is not SafeStan-compatible for protected data. The safe model deterministically flattens the observed array in `(n, h)` order, fills a matching mean array with `mu_t_fall[(n - 1) * N_heights + h] = t_fall(g, heights[h])`, and scores the protected data exactly once with `obs_t_fall ~ normal(mu_t_fall, sigma_t)`. This is the same sum of normal log densities. Priors and generated quantities are otherwise unchanged.
","model_safe_stan":"functions {
  real t_fall(real g, real h) {
    return sqrt(2 * h / g);
  }
}

data {
  int N_heights;
  array[N_heights] real<lower=0> heights;    // meters
  int N_drops;
  array[N_drops * N_heights] real obs_t_fall; // seconds, flattened by drop then height
}

parameters {
  real<lower=0> sigma_t; // seconds
  real g;                // meters per second squared
}

model {
  array[N_drops * N_heights] real mu_t_fall;

  // Prior model
  sigma_t ~ normal(0, 0.5);
  g ~ inv_gamma(1.49, 2.83);

  // Observational model
  for (n in 1:N_drops) {
    for (h in 1:N_heights) {
      mu_t_fall[(n - 1) * N_heights + h] = t_fall(g, heights[h]);
    }
  }
  obs_t_fall ~ normal(mu_t_fall, sigma_t);
}

// Simulate a full observation from each value of the parameters
generated quantities {
  array[N_drops, N_heights] real obs_t_fall_post_pred;

  for (n in 1:N_drops) {
    for (h in 1:N_heights) {
      real mu_t_fall = t_fall(g, heights[h]);
      obs_t_fall_post_pred[n, h] = normal_rng(mu_t_fall, sigma_t);
    }
  }
}
","data_safe_json":"{"N_heights":3,"heights":[1.2024057632914134,4.996567834899339,3.680945353285029],"N_drops":2,"obs_t_fall":[5.360967218465701,4.060817838558089,3.728283018925249,2.5053673589275967,3.424934805389847,6.544717389154932]}","protected_variables":["obs_t_fall"]}
